  "analysis": "Both responses outline lanes, senior‑staff approval, fallback asset generation, and rollback plans. MGK gives a very granular merge‑train and local visual‑regression strategy, but it doesn’t directly address the CI 30‑minute timeout beyond “run locally”. XPQ explicitly mitigates the CI timeout by sharding the visual‑regression suite and marking timeouts as warnings, adds a dedicated backward‑compatibility build job, and proposes a phased canary rollout, which more directly tackles the known pipeline constraints and reduces likely follow‑up questions.",
  "verdict": "XPQ"
}
